(5411644, 778676, 60173, '<td valign="top">The base of the middle leaf seems just a touch hot, but I love the softness of the overall photo and the awesome gradient from deep grey to black. A quality shot for sure.</td>', 'The base of the middle leaf seems just a touch hot, but I love the softness of the overall photo and the awesome gradient from deep grey to black. A quality shot for sure.', '2009-04-01 07:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411648, 778618, 60173, '<td valign="top">More smoke, less stem! The colors and idea are freaking awesome. I might have to go outside and torch some flowers this weekend.</td>', 'More smoke, less stem! The colors and idea are freaking awesome. I might have to go outside and torch some flowers this weekend.', '2009-04-01 07:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411655, 777222, 60173, '<td valign="top">The red border actually detracts from the natural beauty of the red flowers. Let the flowers speak for themselves.</td>', 'The red border actually detracts from the natural beauty of the red flowers. Let the flowers speak for themselves.', '2009-04-01 07:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411661, 777402, 60173, '<td valign="top">Gotta love that low sun light. I feel like flopping on the ground and rolling down the hill. I''d go into a sneezing fit after about 10 feet, but it might be worth it.</td>', 'Gotta love that low sun light. I feel like flopping on the ground and rolling down the hill. I''d go into a sneezing fit after about 10 feet, but it might be worth it.', '2009-04-01 07:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411723, 776718, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this in BW. The background seems a touch mottled.  Maybe adjusting shadows in levels could fix that.  Still, nicely composed with good tonal range. 7</td>', 'I like this in BW. The background seems a touch mottled.  Maybe adjusting shadows in levels could fix that.  Still, nicely composed with good tonal range. 7', '2009-04-01 08:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411724, 777447, 97475, '<td valign="top">I think your photo is too small to assess.</td>', 'I think your photo is too small to assess.', '2009-04-01 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411743, 777893, 97475, '<td valign="top">Nice and beautiful macro. Great control of the whites.</td>', 'Nice and beautiful macro. Great control of the whites.', '2009-04-01 08:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411747, 777294, 97475, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit too small to assess.</td>', 'The photo is a bit too small to assess.', '2009-04-01 08:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411757, 777051, 97475, '<td valign="top">I think the sharpness of the flower is too soft.</td>', 'I think the sharpness of the flower is too soft.', '2009-04-01 08:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411760, 778080, 97475, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Beautiful colours. And very sharp.</td>', 'Great macro. Beautiful colours. And very sharp.', '2009-04-01 08:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411772, 776565, 97475, '<td valign="top">The horizon is tilt to the right. I think the photo is too soft.</td>', 'The horizon is tilt to the right. I think the photo is too soft.', '2009-04-01 09:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411777, 778044, 97475, '<td valign="top">I think your flash making this photo flat.</td>', 'I think your flash making this photo flat.', '2009-04-01 09:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411807, 778515, 97475, '<td valign="top">Your main subject is out of focus.</td>', 'Your main subject is out of focus.', '2009-04-01 09:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411826, 778328, 105047, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors. Im partially color-blind and I''m finding I really like the blue/violet sort of color against the green. The small incidental details on the leaf on the bottom-right corner are framed nicely by the out of focus flowers in front of it. Very pretty.</td>', 'I really love the colors. Im partially color-blind and I''m finding I really like the blue/violet sort of color against the green. The small incidental details on the leaf on the bottom-right corner are framed nicely by the out of focus flowers in front of it. Very pretty.', '2009-04-01 09:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411830, 777095, 105047, '<td valign="top">What great detail. I almost wish the petals weren''t in the picture. That part of the flower (no idea its real name) is just so cool looking and I feel you lose some of the outline of it in the top-left corner. Still, really nice and unconventional take on the "macro-flower."</td>', 'What great detail. I almost wish the petals weren''t in the picture. That part of the flower (no idea its real name) is just so cool looking and I feel you lose some of the outline of it in the top-left corner. Still, really nice and unconventional take on the "macro-flower."', '2009-04-01 09:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411832, 777110, 97475, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2009-04-01 09:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411834, 778549, 105047, '<td valign="top">I love leaf veins. Kind of the feel I was going for with my entry, but your contrast between the veins and the leaf is superb. It really brings out the amazing pattern. I wish the top-right corner was as crisp as the rest of the picture, but that truly is nit-picking. Nice shot.</td>', 'I love leaf veins. Kind of the feel I was going for with my entry, but your contrast between the veins and the leaf is superb. It really brings out the amazing pattern. I wish the top-right corner was as crisp as the rest of the picture, but that truly is nit-picking. Nice shot.', '2009-04-01 09:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411845, 777955, 105047, '<td valign="top">Those reflections are awesome. I wish you could''ve gotten all of them in focus, but then again, that depth-of-field blurriness makes the flower just seem huge, and that''s pretty cool.</td>', 'Those reflections are awesome. I wish you could''ve gotten all of them in focus, but then again, that depth-of-field blurriness makes the flower just seem huge, and that''s pretty cool.', '2009-04-01 09:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411858, 777970, 105047, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite upon first glance. However, if you look at it for 15 seconds or so everything starts to move a little and get a bit blurry. Abstract indeed! I also like the fact that you''ve focused more on the basic outline of the plant, not color or texture or (insert fancy photography related word here). Ha....i dont know much about photography. I''m glad that I stopped to look at your shot for a couple of minutes. Now it''s time to rest my eyes ;) 6</td>', 'Not my favorite upon first glance. However, if you look at it for 15 seconds or so everything starts to move a little and get a bit blurry. Abstract indeed! I also like the fact that you''ve focused more on the basic outline of the plant, not color or texture or (insert fancy photography related word here). Ha....i dont know much about photography. I''m glad that I stopped to look at your shot for a couple of minutes. Now it''s time to rest my eyes ;) 6', '2009-04-01 09:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411864, 778572, 105047, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. I wish you could''ve gotten closer, but I understand. Heh, frog leaping at camera would''ve been a good Fauna entry. I like how the frog is almost an extension of the plant. Good title, as well.</td>', 'Really great shot. I wish you could''ve gotten closer, but I understand. Heh, frog leaping at camera would''ve been a good Fauna entry. I like how the frog is almost an extension of the plant. Good title, as well.', '2009-04-01 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411873, 778010, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Very artful.</td>', 'I really like this.  Very artful.', '2009-04-01 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411875, 778622, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of them glowing in the dark.  I think that red border really takes away from the beauty of the orchids.</td>', 'I like the sense of them glowing in the dark.  I think that red border really takes away from the beauty of the orchids.', '2009-04-01 09:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411882, 776777, 89468, '<td valign="top">It is so very sweet. This would make a great cover on a poetry book.</td>', 'It is so very sweet. This would make a great cover on a poetry book.', '2009-04-01 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411893, 777954, 89468, '<td valign="top">Great colors, warm and fresh at the same time!</td>', 'Great colors, warm and fresh at the same time!', '2009-04-01 09:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411923, 777949, 105047, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome. I have these growing in my front yard, and a pic of them is actually my desktop right now. <a href="//viewmorepics.myspace.com/index.cfm?fuseaction=viewImage&amp;friendID=118225214&amp;albumID=2279519&amp;imageID=35500240" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Wild Flower in Dallas, TX</a> The angle on your shot is very cool. It looks as if the flower is reaching for something. The detail on the leaves is very nice and reminds us that flowers are only part of the story. There''s a whole plant underneath it which is just as beautiful as the bloom.</td>', 'Thats awesome. I have these growing in my front yard, and a pic of them is actually my desktop right now. Wild Flower in Dallas, TX The angle on your shot is very cool. It looks as if the flower is reaching for something. The detail on the leaves is very nice and reminds us that flowers are only part of the story. There''s a whole plant underneath it which is just as beautiful as the bloom.', '2009-04-01 09:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411926, 777451, 105047, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the drip. I''m glad that the background has enough detail to not be boring(especially the bottom-right corner), yet nothing takes attention away from your subject. Nice job</td>', 'Great shot, I love the drip. I''m glad that the background has enough detail to not be boring(especially the bottom-right corner), yet nothing takes attention away from your subject. Nice job', '2009-04-01 10:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411930, 778618, 105047, '<td valign="top">Very apt title. I like the contrast between the soft streamers coming off the flower and the stark detail of the flower itself.</td>', 'Very apt title. I like the contrast between the soft streamers coming off the flower and the stark detail of the flower itself.', '2009-04-01 10:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411939, 777110, 105047, '<td valign="top">An angel with a barn-owl face. That is really cool. A "Choir of Angels" collection would be cool. All sorts of orchids shot at that cool angle and zoom. Very pretty.</td>', 'An angel with a barn-owl face. That is really cool. A "Choir of Angels" collection would be cool. All sorts of orchids shot at that cool angle and zoom. Very pretty.', '2009-04-01 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411947, 777997, 105047, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is really cool with that ground. I wish the flower had been forward just a bit so all of it would be in focus. I like the angle everything is at</td>', 'The depth of field is really cool with that ground. I wish the flower had been forward just a bit so all of it would be in focus. I like the angle everything is at', '2009-04-01 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411966, 778204, 105503, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the shading where he stem meets the flower.</td>', 'I particularly like the shading where he stem meets the flower.', '2009-04-01 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411967, 778359, 105047, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''ve never seen that before. What a cool flower. I like how the lines in the background are going in the opposite diagonal of the flower. I wish you had been a little closer to it, but that''s only because I''d like to see some more fine detail on the weird flower. Great shot.</td>', 'Wow. I''ve never seen that before. What a cool flower. I like how the lines in the background are going in the opposite diagonal of the flower. I wish you had been a little closer to it, but that''s only because I''d like to see some more fine detail on the weird flower. Great shot.', '2009-04-01 10:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411973, 777224, 105503, '<td valign="top">Somehow this makes me laugh.</td>', 'Somehow this makes me laugh.', '2009-04-01 10:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411975, 778506, 105503, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.</td>', 'Great depth of field.', '2009-04-01 10:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411978, 777952, 105047, '<td valign="top">The light on the petals is pretty cool, especially against the dark background. Why aren''t there any bioluminescent (sp?) flowers. That would be cool. Well, they''ve made glow in the dark cats, so why not flowers? Until then, I''m going to have to "borrow" your idea and see what cool shots I come up with :) Great shot.</td>', 'The light on the petals is pretty cool, especially against the dark background. Why aren''t there any bioluminescent (sp?) flowers. That would be cool. Well, they''ve made glow in the dark cats, so why not flowers? Until then, I''m going to have to "borrow" your idea and see what cool shots I come up with :) Great shot.', '2009-04-01 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411998, 777770, 51597, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic flare..</td>', 'Nice artistic flare..', '2009-04-01 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412004, 777128, 51597, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect..</td>', 'Very nice effect..', '2009-04-01 10:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412007, 777774, 51597, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal Thorns!! <br/> <br/>Cool...</td>', 'Up close and personal Thorns!!  Cool...', '2009-04-01 10:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412107, 778581, 9462, '<td valign="top">It''s like seeing photosynthesis in action.</td>', 'It''s like seeing photosynthesis in action.', '2009-04-01 11:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412109, 777690, 104776, '<td valign="top">Composed fairly well.  Enjoy the juxtaposition of the flowers vs. city.  Needs a little more "pop" to it and maybe some sort of dominant point of focus.  Good idea though... I do believe I see what you were aiming at getting across.</td>', 'Composed fairly well.  Enjoy the juxtaposition of the flowers vs. city.  Needs a little more "pop" to it and maybe some sort of dominant point of focus.  Good idea though... I do believe I see what you were aiming at getting across.', '2009-04-01 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412112, 778077, 104776, '<td valign="top">Good subject colors; green on yellow.  However, the out of focus greenery in front of the flower is a bit distracting and takes away from the main subject.</td>', 'Good subject colors; green on yellow.  However, the out of focus greenery in front of the flower is a bit distracting and takes away from the main subject.', '2009-04-01 11:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412118, 777031, 104776, '<td valign="top">Definitely has an interesting alien feel to it.  Focus is well done.  I''m not a fan of the tone... I think maybe a straight b+w may have worked better?</td>', 'Definitely has an interesting alien feel to it.  Focus is well done.  I''m not a fan of the tone... I think maybe a straight b+w may have worked better?', '2009-04-01 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412121, 777981, 104776, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Excellent light and good contrast.  Subject itself kinda gets funky on the left side, but otherwise I rather enjoy this!</td>', 'Nice!  Excellent light and good contrast.  Subject itself kinda gets funky on the left side, but otherwise I rather enjoy this!', '2009-04-01 11:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412124, 778019, 104776, '<td valign="top">Great light and contrast.  Colors are not overpowering (something I have a hard time with flowers) and your focus appears spot on.  Good composition too... makes me think the two flowers are snuggling!</td>', 'Great light and contrast.  Colors are not overpowering (something I have a hard time with flowers) and your focus appears spot on.  Good composition too... makes me think the two flowers are snuggling!', '2009-04-01 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412128, 778473, 104776, '<td valign="top">Good window light... gives it a very nice feel.  I wish the b+w conversion had given some more definition between the flower petals and the stems/leaves.  Very nice shot though!</td>', 'Good window light... gives it a very nice feel.  I wish the b+w conversion had given some more definition between the flower petals and the stems/leaves.  Very nice shot though!', '2009-04-01 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412138, 778672, 104776, '<td valign="top">Nifty idea.  The shadow on the flower''s left side (behind the leftmost petal) kind of distracts.</td>', 'Nifty idea.  The shadow on the flower''s left side (behind the leftmost petal) kind of distracts.', '2009-04-01 11:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412144, 778211, 104776, '<td valign="top">Very classy.  Great focus and colors.</td>', 'Very classy.  Great focus and colors.', '2009-04-01 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412150, 777229, 104776, '<td valign="top">The string of pearls decoration at the bottom of the blinds is a wee bit distracting.</td>', 'The string of pearls decoration at the bottom of the blinds is a wee bit distracting.', '2009-04-01 11:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412152, 778307, 104776, '<td valign="top">Good light and detail.  Feels maybe a bit oversharpened, however.  Great color.</td>', 'Good light and detail.  Feels maybe a bit oversharpened, however.  Great color.', '2009-04-01 11:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412154, 778181, 104776, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the entire bouquet.  I like the idea though!</td>', 'I would have liked to see the entire bouquet.  I like the idea though!', '2009-04-01 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412155, 776893, 104776, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit snap-shotish.  The main focus feels more on the path than the plant-life.</td>', 'Seems a bit snap-shotish.  The main focus feels more on the path than the plant-life.', '2009-04-01 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412160, 777223, 104776, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like the feeling conveyed.  I like how the out of focus rocks look.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice! I like the feeling conveyed.  I like how the out of focus rocks look.  Good job.', '2009-04-01 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412172, 778513, 104776, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh.  The small yellow flower kind of distracts.  I''d crop it out next time.</td>', 'Good bokeh.  The small yellow flower kind of distracts.  I''d crop it out next time.', '2009-04-01 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412177, 778204, 104776, '<td valign="top">Sharp!  The beads of water kinda make me want to eat it.  Loos crispy.  Very good job.  The light and focus are very well done.</td>', 'Sharp!  The beads of water kinda make me want to eat it.  Loos crispy.  Very good job.  The light and focus are very well done.', '2009-04-01 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412179, 776937, 75742, '<td valign="top">\</td>', '\', '2009-04-01 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412180, 777038, 104776, '<td valign="top">Little too soft.  Needs a boost in contrast.  Good subject and framing, however.</td>', 'Little too soft.  Needs a boost in contrast.  Good subject and framing, however.', '2009-04-01 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412190, 778588, 104776, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Good "pop" factor here.  I wish the tree was a wee bit more prominant compared to the ground, but hard to control that!  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice sky.  Good "pop" factor here.  I wish the tree was a wee bit more prominant compared to the ground, but hard to control that!  Very nice photo.', '2009-04-01 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412196, 777051, 104776, '<td valign="top">Very good composition.  I like the visible reflection.  However, lacks good focus and contrast.</td>', 'Very good composition.  I like the visible reflection.  However, lacks good focus and contrast.', '2009-04-01 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412200, 777530, 104776, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of some sort of alien creature.  Very cool.  Excellent focus.</td>', 'Makes me think of some sort of alien creature.  Very cool.  Excellent focus.', '2009-04-01 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412201, 777042, 104776, '<td valign="top">Nifty lighting.  Good focus and composition.  Very classy photo!</td>', 'Nifty lighting.  Good focus and composition.  Very classy photo!', '2009-04-01 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5412206, 778600, 104776, '<td valign="top">Lighting didn''t work to well here.  Those shadows are a big distraction.  There''s a lot going on as well... not sure where I should be focusing.</td>', 'Lighting didn''t work to well here.  Those shadows are a big distraction.  There''s a lot going on as well... not sure where I should be focusing.', '2009-04-01 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
