(5412303, 777222, 98141, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice, I think the small spot of blue in the upper right corner is distracting but so small it''s not really noticeable. I think the contrast could use to go up a bit and I''m not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Composition is nice, I think the small spot of blue in the upper right corner is distracting but so small it''s not really noticeable. I think the contrast could use to go up a bit and I''m not a fan of the border.', '2009-04-01 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
