(5419742, 778590, 104950, '<td valign="top">bright and clear. The flower almost seems to become brighter after looking at the image for a few seconds, perhaps something to do with the darker background, or the inner yellow parts...</td>', 'bright and clear. The flower almost seems to become brighter after looking at the image for a few seconds, perhaps something to do with the darker background, or the inner yellow parts...', '2009-04-05 15:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
