(5420311, 777774, 93283, '<td valign="top">Stay Away indeed, I really like the depth of field in this photo and it really brings out the thorns. I think its a unique shot and it stands out... Well Done!</td>', 'Stay Away indeed, I really like the depth of field in this photo and it really brings out the thorns. I think its a unique shot and it stands out... Well Done!', '2009-04-05 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
