(5420317, 777363, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept and excellent execution. Great shot!</td>', 'Very cool concept and excellent execution. Great shot!', '2009-04-05 23:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420318, 778643, 93283, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, I love it. Especially the Black and White in this challenge where color seems to be everything, I like the B&amp;W outside the box. Well done</td>', 'Nice and simple, I love it. Especially the Black and White in this challenge where color seems to be everything, I like the B&W outside the box. Well done', '2009-04-05 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420319, 777224, 93283, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot. I love it, simple and effective. Well done</td>', 'Wow, great shot. I love it, simple and effective. Well done', '2009-04-05 23:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420329, 777700, 31456, '<td valign="top">The cute factor should bring you some higher scores, but I don''t see flora as the <b>main </b>subject here...</td>', 'The cute factor should bring you some higher scores, but I don''t see flora as the main subject here...', '2009-04-05 23:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420332, 777115, 31456, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble with the composition and sharpness. A portrait-orientation crop cutting ~5% from the left edge and ~45% from the right edge would have worked much better in my opinion, as would have a wider aperture to make the background more blurry and give the subject more pop. Color is excellent.</td>', 'I''m having trouble with the composition and sharpness. A portrait-orientation crop cutting ~5% from the left edge and ~45% from the right edge would have worked much better in my opinion, as would have a wider aperture to make the background more blurry and give the subject more pop. Color is excellent.', '2009-04-05 23:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420334, 777031, 31456, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, though I''m not sure I like the frame/border. I''d normally prefer a blurrier background, too, but the way it goes from sharp to semi-sharp to semi-blurry to blurry works excellently in this case. 7</td>', 'Very nice shot, though I''m not sure I like the frame/border. I''d normally prefer a blurrier background, too, but the way it goes from sharp to semi-sharp to semi-blurry to blurry works excellently in this case. 7', '2009-04-05 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420338, 777505, 31456, '<td valign="top">I''m being really nitpicky here, but I feel like I have to give constructive criticism or else my comments are useless.<br/> <br/>Just a few things - the shadow on the bottom-right distracts a bit, the highlights are blown just left of that shadow, and a background may have made the image a little more interesting.<br/> <br/>I like the sharpness and the color a lot.</td>', 'I''m being really nitpicky here, but I feel like I have to give constructive criticism or else my comments are useless. Just a few things - the shadow on the bottom-right distracts a bit, the highlights are blown just left of that shadow, and a background may have made the image a little more interesting. I like the sharpness and the color a lot.', '2009-04-05 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420340, 777227, 31456, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, though the background doesn''t make the image as a whole very interesting. The color is great, and the frame works very well.</td>', 'Very interesting subject, though the background doesn''t make the image as a whole very interesting. The color is great, and the frame works very well.', '2009-04-05 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420343, 778478, 31456, '<td valign="top">Mmm, tasty! I like the abstract...ness (?) of the shot. The sharp part on the lower left distracts a bit, but not much. Nice color and great sharpness in the subject.</td>', 'Mmm, tasty! I like the abstract...ness (?) of the shot. The sharp part on the lower left distracts a bit, but not much. Nice color and great sharpness in the subject.', '2009-04-05 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420348, 777042, 31456, '<td valign="top">Tack-sharp, but some quality got lost in the resizing process. The color is nice, and in this case, I''m liking the lack of an interesting background. However, the shadow on it interrupts the lines and makes it fade out in that one part.</td>', 'Tack-sharp, but some quality got lost in the resizing process. The color is nice, and in this case, I''m liking the lack of an interesting background. However, the shadow on it interrupts the lines and makes it fade out in that one part.', '2009-04-05 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420354, 777447, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white, but the image doesn''t scream "flora," because the flora in the image is silhouetted.</td>', 'I like the black and white, but the image doesn''t scream "flora," because the flora in the image is silhouetted.', '2009-04-05 23:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420366, 778289, 31456, '<td valign="top">The color and background sharpness are great, but the subject seems "cut" by the crop. I really like the subject sharpness, especially when we have to work with such small image sizes.</td>', 'The color and background sharpness are great, but the subject seems "cut" by the crop. I really like the subject sharpness, especially when we have to work with such small image sizes.', '2009-04-05 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420376, 777816, 31456, '<td valign="top">I promised myself I''d give constructive criticism on everything, but I can''t think of any. Let''s be nitpicky... the middle could be sharper? I don''t know. 9</td>', 'I promised myself I''d give constructive criticism on everything, but I can''t think of any. Let''s be nitpicky... the middle could be sharper? I don''t know. 9', '2009-04-05 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420393, 778065, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the color and depth of field, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the closest flowers (the blurry ones) ''cause they''re so bright. A shot from a higher position and with more sky would''ve worked better in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the color and depth of field, but my eyes keep getting drawn to the closest flowers (the blurry ones) ''cause they''re so bright. A shot from a higher position and with more sky would''ve worked better in my opinion.', '2009-04-05 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420407, 778643, 31456, '<td valign="top">Would''ve liked a closer crop on the left for balance, but everything else is pretty much perfect in my opinion. 9</td>', 'Would''ve liked a closer crop on the left for balance, but everything else is pretty much perfect in my opinion. 9', '2009-04-06 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420413, 777684, 31456, '<td valign="top">Aww, that''s so sweet! Good concept, nice color and lighting. Would''ve liked to see more of the subject.</td>', 'Aww, that''s so sweet! Good concept, nice color and lighting. Would''ve liked to see more of the subject.', '2009-04-06 00:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420419, 778081, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is almost perfect. I wish all the leaves/petals were either as sharp as the one on the left, or as blurry as the ones on the right, but who am I to judge? I could never take a picture this good.</td>', 'This is almost perfect. I wish all the leaves/petals were either as sharp as the one on the left, or as blurry as the ones on the right, but who am I to judge? I could never take a picture this good.', '2009-04-06 00:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420425, 777757, 31456, '<td valign="top">Classic subject, but maybe too classic. Good color and DOF. Composition is okay - I''d like either less of the bottom part or more of the top part.</td>', 'Classic subject, but maybe too classic. Good color and DOF. Composition is okay - I''d like either less of the bottom part or more of the top part.', '2009-04-06 00:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420435, 778647, 31456, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, but I''m having trouble seeing "flora" as the <b>main</b> focus. It''s more of a skyscape.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, but I''m having trouble seeing "flora" as the main focus. It''s more of a skyscape.', '2009-04-06 00:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420438, 777930, 31456, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Kinda creepy (not in a bad way), and very unexpected. Good composition; would''ve liked more interesting lighting.</td>', 'Whoa! Kinda creepy (not in a bad way), and very unexpected. Good composition; would''ve liked more interesting lighting.', '2009-04-06 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420441, 776773, 31456, '<td valign="top">Superb. Color, sharpness, composition...</td>', 'Superb. Color, sharpness, composition...', '2009-04-06 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420443, 777736, 31456, '<td valign="top">Color-wise, it''s great; subject sharpness, also great; composition-wise, pretty good - the background is a little busy and the subject placement not too original.</td>', 'Color-wise, it''s great; subject sharpness, also great; composition-wise, pretty good - the background is a little busy and the subject placement not too original.', '2009-04-06 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420447, 777970, 31456, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, and very nice. One of them is out of line, but that''s okay.</td>', 'Very abstract, and very nice. One of them is out of line, but that''s okay.', '2009-04-06 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420450, 777530, 31456, '<td valign="top">That looks like some weird sci-fi game. 10</td>', 'That looks like some weird sci-fi game. 10', '2009-04-06 00:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420454, 778175, 31456, '<td valign="top">I think you could''ve used the background better had you taken more time to compose the shot better. Also, it''s a little too blurry in the foreground, like you were focusing on the farther ones. I like the water drops.</td>', 'I think you could''ve used the background better had you taken more time to compose the shot better. Also, it''s a little too blurry in the foreground, like you were focusing on the farther ones. I like the water drops.', '2009-04-06 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420463, 777919, 31456, '<td valign="top">In most cases, fungi aren''t considered flora. Nice sharpness and composition, though...</td>', 'In most cases, fungi aren''t considered flora. Nice sharpness and composition, though...', '2009-04-06 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
