(5423755, 778515, 79720, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s already been said, but your subject is badly out of focus, and the on-board flash did not help.<br/> <br/>If you were taking this image in the dark or near-dark, a tripod is necessary so you can forego the flash and use a longer shutter speed. Also, try a manual focus instead of letting the camera try to autofocus in a low-light situation.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s already been said, but your subject is badly out of focus, and the on-board flash did not help. If you were taking this image in the dark or near-dark, a tripod is necessary so you can forego the flash and use a longer shutter speed. Also, try a manual focus instead of letting the camera try to autofocus in a low-light situation.', '2009-04-07 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
