(5425120, 778204, 5475, '<td valign="top">Beauty, eh? Love the colors, drops of water, composition is not original, but I like it.<br/>Sharpness/DOF not quite where I would like it, but that could be limitations on file size/JPG compression.  Solid 8...</td>', 'Beauty, eh? Love the colors, drops of water, composition is not original, but I like it.Sharpness/DOF not quite where I would like it, but that could be limitations on file size/JPG compression.  Solid 8...', '2009-04-08 00:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425126, 778211, 5475, '<td valign="top">HOw can you go wrong here.  Love the subtle, even lighting without any hot spots.  God took care of the shapes, colors, details.  You did almost as well with the technical aspects. 10 from me....</td>', 'HOw can you go wrong here.  Love the subtle, even lighting without any hot spots.  God took care of the shapes, colors, details.  You did almost as well with the technical aspects. 10 from me....', '2009-04-08 00:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
